{"unit_id":"yumusb__dsh-opencode-go-plus#card-zh","repo":"yumusb/dsh-opencode-go-plus","commit":"56b9b2fc9e2b80b66871032f504748e66942cb95","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-opencode-go-plus（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 OpenCode GO 提供独立的 DSH 模型接入路由。适配器按模型选择 OpenAI Completions、Anthropic Messages 或 OpenAI Responses 协议，并从模型目录获取能力信息。可在插件设置卡片查看和刷新模型、选择启用项、测试凭据和检查模型可用性，也可用聊天命令同步模型列表。适合希望在 DSH Web 中使用 OpenCode GO 多协议模型的用户；需要 OpenCode GO 订阅和 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:823-889","lib/adapter.js:302-366"]}
{"unit_id":"yumusb__dsh-opencode-go-plus#card-en","repo":"yumusb/dsh-opencode-go-plus","commit":"56b9b2fc9e2b80b66871032f504748e66942cb95","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-opencode-go-plus connects OpenCode GO to DSH Web with a dedicated model route. It selects a protocol per model and reads capabilities from the catalog. The settings card lists models, saves selections, tests credentials, and checks availability. Requires an OpenCode GO subscription and API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:823-889","lib/adapter.js:302-366"]}
